 "_provenance": [
  "BACKLOG-4018 migration v76 fixture. Output of the REAL 2.42 writers, not hand-made rows.",
  "Producer: a throwaway jest test run at commit e8841608b (the BACKLOG-3908 base; messageDbService.ts and transactionService.ts are identical to v2.42.0 there).",
  "Writers: transactionService.linkMessages, createThreadCommunicationReference, linkedTextMessageIdsForThreads + unlinkMessages (remove conversation), and a real DELETE FROM transactions (case F6, FK ON DELETE SET NULL).",
  "Run: ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE=1 npx electron ./node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --bail=0 <producer test>, then every column of users_local, transactions, messages, communications dumped.",
  "Exception: case F9 (communications ids c-F9-1, c-F9-2) is TRANSCRIBED, NOT EXECUTED: the BACKLOG-2550 half-link is a crash between two statements and cannot be run. Same shape as F1.",
  "The producer cannot run on the current tree: BACKLOG-3908 removed the NULL write it relies on. Every row is synthetic (example.com, 555-01xx).",
  "communications ids: the writers' random UUIDs are replaced with c-<message or thread>-<deal> (the public-repo fixture guard refuses bare UUIDs). Row order, and so rowid order, is unchanged."
